## Interface: 120001, 120005, 120007, 120100, 120105, 16001
## Title: |cffe51039Suspicion|r|cffffffffPack|r — Options
## Notes: Options panel for the pack (SuspicionsPack plugin)
## Author: Cruzz
## Version: 2.8.1
## Category: |cffe51039Cruzz|r |cffffffffAddons|r
## Dependencies: SuspicionsPack
# A VALID but fully transparent texture, not an absent line: the client
# draws its own question-mark placeholder when an addon declares no icon,
# so "no icon" has to be spelled out rather than omitted.
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\SuspicionsPack\Media\Icons\blank.png
## LoadOnDemand: 1

# The options UI. None of it is needed until the user actually opens the window,
# so it is a load-on-demand companion rather than part of the login path.
#
# Saved variables stay in the parent addon: these files only ever read SP.db.

# Core — load order matters. Theme defines the paint registry every other file
# uses; Widgets builds on it; Layout builds on Widgets; Shell needs all of them.
Core\Theme.lua
Core\Widgets.lua
Core\ColorWidgets.lua
Core\AnchorWidgets.lua
Core\Layout.lua
Core\Shell.lua

# Categories must come before the pages that attach themselves to them.
Pages\Categories.lua

# Pages — one file each. Order within a category is the order in the sidebar.
# [AllowLoadGameType standard] mirrors the parent .toc: a page is only loaded where
# its module is, so the sidebar never shows a page for a module that does not exist.
# InterruptAlert and MovementAlert carry no condition, like their modules: both pages
# read the module's IS_FOREVER flag and its per-class tables on WoW: Forever.
Pages\Home.lua
Pages\Automation.lua
Pages\AutoRelease.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\TankMD.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\BloodlustAlert.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\CombatCross.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\CombatTimer.lua
Pages\Cursor.lua
Pages\DeathAlert.lua
Pages\GatewayAlert.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\InterruptAlert.lua
Pages\MovementAlert.lua
Pages\PotionAlert.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\ReapPredict.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\SpellEffectAlpha.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\FocusTargetMarker.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\GroupJoinedReminder.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\AutoPlaystyle.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\FilterExpansionOnly.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\AutoBuy.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\CraftShopper.lua
Pages\FastLoot.lua
Pages\Durability.lua
Pages\GroupInvitations.lua
Pages\WhisperAlert.lua
Pages\CleanObjectiveHeader.lua
Pages\CopyTooltip.lua
Pages\EnhancedObjectiveText.lua
Pages\MicroMenuSkin.lua
Pages\AnimatedPortraits.lua
Pages\PlayerDragon.lua
Pages\DetailsSkin.lua [AllowLoadGameType camelot][ExcludeLoadGameType standard, classic]
Pages\Drawer.lua
Pages\Performance.lua
Pages\SilvermoonMapIcon.lua [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Pages\CVars.lua
